--                          track primitives near the car, pairs), after each export 005543f0 (world record + track
--                          query 005f58d0 -> 0051370a) + 00551480 (external force accumulators cleared), contact
--                          passes 00578da0 / 00578de0 (tyre spheres -> 0055e1e0 of the core, body spheres -> walls)
